 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 4.52,
   "text": "Hey everyone, thank you so much for clicking on my page. I'm Mo, a freshman at the University"
  },
  {
   "start": 4.52,
   "end": 8.38,
   "text": "of Pennsylvania, and I thought I'd tell you a bit about why I started this page. So"
  },
  {
   "start": 8.38,
   "end": 13.24,
   "text": "growing up, I hated history. There'd be these names and dates and treaties that I had to"
  },
  {
   "start": 13.24,
   "end": 17.92,
   "text": "memorize, and I didn't enjoy that. There was no translation between that and my daily"
  },
  {
   "start": 17.92,
   "end": 22.52,
   "text": "life. But then I'd go home, and my dad, who was absolutely obsessed with history, would"
  },
  {
   "start": 22.52,
   "end": 26.3,
   "text": "tell me these stories I'd never heard before, and he'd say them in a way that was fun and"
  },
  {
   "start": 26.3,
   "end": 31.34,
   "text": "engaging and simple enough that it left out all those relevant details. And it finished off with"
  },
  {
   "start": 31.34,
   "end": 36.34,
   "text": "one lesson that I could take from the story and apply into my daily life. And I saw so much value"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.34,
   "end": 40.16,
   "text": "in that. So I thought I'd share that value with you guys. Every single day, I'm going to be"
  },
  {
   "start": 40.16,
   "end": 44.42,
   "text": "thinking one story that I hope you guys have never heard before and explaining it in a way that's"
  },
  {
   "start": 44.42,
   "end": 49.16,
   "text": "simple and fun and engaging and hopefully pretty visual as well. Claude will help me with that."
  },
  {
   "start": 49.98,
   "end": 53.86,
   "text": "And I'm going to be finishing off with one lesson from that story that you can take and"
  },
  {
   "start": 53.86,
   "end": 58.24,
   "text": "apply into your daily life. So I hope you guys gain some value from this account. If you see"
  },
  {
   "start": 58.24,
   "end": 61.52,
   "text": "some football content on the account as well, that's just because I really love the game. So"
  },
  {
   "start": 61.52,
   "end": 64.4,
   "text": "ignore that. But anyway, I'll see you guys tomorrow."
  }
 ],
